      "severity": "minor",
      "problem": "The claim states 'always stretch your body after waking up' but the study only measured acute effects during relaxation period, not post-waking routine.",
      "requested_action": "More evidence on habitual stretching routines and long-term effects needed"
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "problem": "The study's measured outcome is acute shear rate change during relaxation, not general circulation boost as claimed.",
      "requested_action": "More evidence on systemic circulation and long-term benefits required"
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "problem": "The study only examined young men, not general population, and the effect is localized to one leg's peripheral artery.",
      "requested_action": "More evidence on broader population and systemic circulation needed"
    }
  ],
  "remaining_gaps": [
    "Long-term effects of morning stretching",
    "Systemic circulation impact",
    "General population applicability"
  ]
}
